@host = http://localhost:5155
@order = demo-001
@root = {{host}}/stateflows/stateMachines/OrderFulfillment/{{order}}

### Submit once per unique order ID; choose a scenario from README.md.
POST {{root}}/submitOrder
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event": {
    "customerEmail": "buyer@example.test",
    "lines": [
      { "sku": "BOOK", "quantity": 2, "unitPrice": 12.50 },
      { "sku": "PEN", "quantity": 3, "unitPrice": 2.00 }
    ],
    "scenario": "HappyPath",
    "callbackDelayMilliseconds": 2000
  }
}

### Active states and available events.
GET {{root}}/status

### Shared Entity projection.
GET {{root}}/summary

### Accepted only before dispatch. Completion is asynchronous.
POST {{root}}/cancelOrder
Content-Type: application/json

{ "event": { "reason": "Customer requested cancellation." } }

### For DeliveryNeedsAttention, wait for NeedsAttention first.
POST {{root}}/retryDelivery
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### For CompensationNeedsAttention, wait for that state first.
POST {{root}}/retryCompensation
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### PlantUML source only; no request to a public renderer.
GET {{root}}/diagram

### Activity must have started.
GET {{root}}/diagrams/reservation

### Activity must have started.
GET {{root}}/diagrams/preparation

### Live projection notifications (keeps the connection open).
GET {{root}}/notifications?names=OrderSnapshot&stream=true
Accept: text/event-stream

### Invalid payload: expect 400, with no background work started.
POST {{host}}/stateflows/stateMachines/OrderFulfillment/invalid-001/submitOrder
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event": {
    "customerEmail": "not-an-email",
    "lines": [{ "sku": "BOOK", "quantity": 0, "unitPrice": -1 }],
    "scenario": "HappyPath",
    "callbackDelayMilliseconds": 500
  }
}
